<Defs>
  <WorkTypeDef>
    <defName>Avir_MagicWork</defName>
    <labelShort>magic</labelShort>
    <pawnLabel>Caster</pawnLabel>
    <gerundLabel>working magic</gerundLabel>
    <description>Work done by magic: water tends the wounded with no medicine and washes the floor round a spot clean, the wind carries a heap of things to the stockpile at once, earth raises rock, smooths, draws ore up and quickens growth where the arcane orders say; the meetings of two elements smelt, cut stone, warm, wash by steam and charge batteries. Each pays Arcana and teaches its element. Casters only.</description>
    <verb>Work magic</verb>
    <naturalPriority>500</naturalPriority>
    <visible>false</visible>
  </WorkTypeDef>

